<title>FRANCE: Block trades of over two pct in Sommer-Allibert.</title>
<headline>Block trades of over two pct in Sommer-Allibert.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>More than two percent of the share capital of Sommer-Allibert changed hands on Wednesday after a series of block trades in the morning, dealers said.</p>
<p>At 1343 GMT, Sommer was up 4.14 percent at 206.2 francs in a turnover of over one billion francs and 497,104 shares traded.</p>
<p>Nobody was available at the company to comment on the activity.</p>
</text>
